            "heading": "How to take Best Hydrate Electrolyte Mix",
            "icon": "plus",
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Dosage: Put one scoop into 500mL\/16oz of drinking water (or two scoops into one liter\/32oz)<\/li><li>Let dissolve - Shake or Stir (~20 seconds)<\/li><li>Drink one liter\/32oz per day for BEST results<\/li><li>Discard unused solution after 12 hrs., or 48 hrs. if refrigerated<\/li><li>Do not mix Best Hydrate with soft drinks, sports drinks, or fruit juices<\/li><li>See peel-back label for more details.<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
